      {
        "id": 164770,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-10T18:11:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>I'm trying to come up with a word that would relate to Dawn (or another name she might have gone by at that time)… Not working. </span> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I put \"Dawn and\" into google to see what it would fill it in with. &nbsp;Oddly enough, \"Dawn and Dusk\" was not the first response.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Google\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Google:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Dawn and Vinegar<br><span>Dawn and Dusk</span><br><span>Dawn and Hawkes</span><br><span>Dawn and Ash</span><br><span>Dawn and Fleas</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
        "post_number": 26,
