        "created_at": "2016-03-10T19:39:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually tried \"Dawn and Pa\" in Google and… Apparently there's something/someone known as \"Dawn and Paul\", because all listed items came back related to them…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\">  (Towards the bottom were \"Dawn and Pakistan\" and \"Dawn and Pachirisu\", neither of which are useful.)</p>",
