        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-10T20:36:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Rabit wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>I'm trying to come up with a word that would relate to Dawn (or another name she might have gone by at that time)... Not working.  :confused: \n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I put “Dawn and” into google to see what it would fill it in with.  Oddly enough, “Dawn and Dusk” was not the first response. <br></p>\n<div><b>Google wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>Dawn and Vinegar\n<p>Dawn and Dusk</p>\n<p>Dawn and Hawkes</p>\n<p>Dawn and Ash</p>\n<p>Dawn and Fleas</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This confused me until I remembered the brand name. What in the world are people doing with their dish soap?</p>\n<p>Wait. Strike that. I don’t want to know the answers.</p>",
